. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Z_0fD0mpZRMQ7kNvwFG_N7J&_nc_oc=AdpLIF-Ye_-bzgIcC5-uf4O_iP7_EMbbDlyofzNbFPIJFCLeo0Rsn6pKjsiFqe5WnMY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8qvOAoOyZMP67mWELfLKpJC-oYpRDOemKuidYxfa3kfw&oe=6A25A3FE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AQuwVrVgiMoQ7kNvwE5w_g2&_nc_oc=AdodhSKKS-4jfK9qoCGOXkVq66Ujy4SZLNCtLQeyx9lWro_naPFoJ70-9w6KdxsOSmo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_X8bUsRI90ZFIvSvsaTFRcUjObO3lCBbqH4nmUV_IePA&oe=6A25825E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=M_uk-SeqeZ0Q7kNvwExFv2M&_nc_oc=AdpgvWZVtdtndVeBjF_HbTKSBpw5Op1fS5TPzBToRi_YMRwhu1XrssCWpxQOfAzaSHM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9q6uOX7MKwjhAOjztSPoxC-iP10pCnV_tG3sQJr_g1AQ&oe=6A2577DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco